<title>UK: Taylor Woodrow wins 36 mln stg contracts.</title>
<headline>Taylor Woodrow wins 36 mln stg contracts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK housing firm Taylor Woodrow Plc said on Tuesday that its unit Taylor Woodrow Constructon has won 36 million stg of facilities management contracts.</p>
<p>The contracts include an 11.5 million stg contract from the Contributions Agency, an executive agency of the Department of Social Security.</p>
<p>The company has also secured facilities management work from the Ministry of Defence and the London Business School.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
